      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRINGVALE MAGIC (4) has a strong record this track and trip including three wins from five starts. Comes off a (22.45) win last time, scoring by a nose in a Grade 6 over 395m at Murray Bridge. Rates on top and should go close. VICTA SPENCER (1) took the sit on the lead but levelled up to score (30.54) at this track in a Grade 5 over 530m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Can measure up again. ICE COOL BLUE (5) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a nose win at Murray Bridge Straight in a handy 17.25. Awkwardly drawn but in form and has the ability. Can make it two on the bounce. VICTA HOWARD (2) has top-three aspirations after placing last time.",
